== Trivia ==
* Trisagion is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=894879673 this Steam Workshop item] by x Wyvern x and TRPG, originally known as Lightshot.
* The name is a reference to one of the oldest Christian hymns.
* The design of Trisagion appears to be that of [[Wikipedia:Borromean rings|Borromean rings]], a Christian symbol of the Trinity.

